      "Saves 23% irrigation water (455 mm/yr \u2014 ~6 flood irrigations and 250 hrs/ha of 5-HP borewell pumping) vs. baseline [FAO-56]. Directly counters regional GRACE-FO terrestrial water storage decline of 0.6 cm/yr.",
