      "Provides a 30-day Kharif-to-Rabi turnaround window for Happy Seeder / zero-till sowing with in-situ residue mulching \u2014 eliminating Oct\u2013Nov stubble burning monitored by NASA FIRMS.",
      "Timely sowing schedule buffers crops against 94 annual extreme heat days (>35\u00b0C) and 43.0 March\u2013April terminal grain-filling heat days (>32\u00b0C) recorded by NASA POWER.",
      "Delivers median net operating return of \u20b9265,903/ha (\u20b9107,607/acre) with a worst-10% drought downside buffer (CVaR-10) of \u20b9254,858/ha (\u20b9103,138/acre) [CACP MSP 2024-25]. Eligible schemes: Crop Diversification / Mera Pani Meri Virasat (\u20b917,500/ha state incentive); Direct-Seeded Rice (DSR) Promotion Scheme (\u20b93,750/ha support)."
